{
  "0": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">For hobby electronics enthusiasts:</div>"
  },
  "1": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">Resistance Code Calculation</div>"
  },
  "2": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The value of a resistor is indicated by colored rings. For those who do not constantly work with these color markings, it is often difficult to determine the correct resistance values from the color rings.</p></div>"
  },
  "3": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The following program demonstrates how the computer can calculate the correct resistance values from the entry of various colors.</p></div>"
  },
  "4": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The piezo buzzer still connected from the last experiment is not needed. Remove the keypad mask that may also still be present, and enter the program according to HALT &ndash; NEXT &ndash; 00.</p></div>"
  },
  "5": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:12.5pt;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">Program: Resistance Code Calculation</div>"
  },
  "6": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<table class=\"timer ann\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:13%\"><col style=\"width:8.5%\"><col style=\"width:10%\"><col style=\"width:18%\"><col style=\"width:14%\"><col style=\"width:36.5%\"></colgroup><tr><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Label</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Adr.</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Code</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Mnemonic</th><th>Jump<br>to</th><th>Explanation</th></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">00</td><td class=\"c\">F19</td><td class=\"m\">DISP 1,9</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"4\">Input routine</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">01</td><td class=\"c\">F08</td><td class=\"m\">CLEAR</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">02</td><td class=\"c\">FF0</td><td class=\"m\">KIN 0</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">03</td><td class=\"c\">9B0</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI B,0</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">04</td><td class=\"c\">D0D</td><td class=\"m\">BRC 0D</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">START</td><td rowspan=\"9\">Key: &uarr;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">05</td><td class=\"c\">519</td><td class=\"m\">ADDI 1,9</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">06</td><td class=\"c\">949</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 4,9</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">07</td><td class=\"c\">D00</td><td class=\"m\">BRC 00</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">08</td><td class=\"c\">034</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 3,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">09</td><td class=\"c\">023</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 2,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">0A</td><td class=\"c\">012</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 1,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">0B</td><td class=\"c\">001</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 0,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">0C</td><td class=\"c\">C02</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 02</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">START</td><td class=\"a\">0D</td><td class=\"c\">922</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 2,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">0E</td><td class=\"c\">D14</td><td class=\"m\">BRC 14</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">KILO</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">0F</td><td class=\"c\">902</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 0,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">10</td><td class=\"c\">E1E</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 1E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">PRO</td><td rowspan=\"3\">(PRO = percentage tolerance)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">11</td><td class=\"c\">B34</td><td class=\"m\">CALL 34</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MORI</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">12</td><td class=\"c\">712</td><td class=\"m\">SUBI 1,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">13</td><td class=\"c\">C0F</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 0F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"23\">Jump to subroutine MORI</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">KILO</td><td class=\"a\">14</td><td class=\"c\">952</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 5,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">15</td><td class=\"c\">D1A</td><td class=\"m\">BRC 1A</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MEGA</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">16</td><td class=\"c\">B34</td><td class=\"m\">CALL 34</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MORI</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">17</td><td class=\"c\">1A3</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI A,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">18</td><td class=\"c\">732</td><td class=\"m\">SUBI 3,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">19</td><td class=\"c\">C0F</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 0F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MEGA</td><td class=\"a\">1A</td><td class=\"c\">B34</td><td class=\"m\">CALL 34</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MORI</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">1B</td><td class=\"c\">1B3</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI B,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">1C</td><td class=\"c\">762</td><td class=\"m\">SUBI 6,2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">1D</td><td class=\"c\">C0F</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 0F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">PRO</td><td class=\"a\">1E</td><td class=\"c\">911</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 1,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">1F</td><td class=\"c\">E2C</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 2C</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 &rarr; E</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">20</td><td class=\"c\">921</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 2,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">21</td><td class=\"c\">E2E</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 2E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 &rarr; E</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">22</td><td class=\"c\">9B1</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI B,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">23</td><td class=\"c\">E30</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 30</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 &rarr; E</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">24</td><td class=\"c\">9A1</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI A,1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">25</td><td class=\"c\">E32</td><td class=\"m\">BRZ 32</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 &rarr; F</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">26</td><td class=\"c\">12F</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 2,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANZ</td><td class=\"a\">27</td><td class=\"c\">F63</td><td class=\"m\">DISP 6,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">28</td><td class=\"c\">FF0</td><td class=\"m\">KIN 0</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">29</td><td class=\"c\">F2E</td><td class=\"m\">DISP 2,E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr></table>"
  },
  "7": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<table class=\"timer ann\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:13%\"><col style=\"width:8.5%\"><col style=\"width:10%\"><col style=\"width:18%\"><col style=\"width:14%\"><col style=\"width:36.5%\"></colgroup><tr><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Label</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Adr.</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Code</th><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Mnemonic</th><th>Jump<br>to</th><th>Explanation</th></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">2A</td><td class=\"c\">FF0</td><td class=\"m\">KIN 0</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"3\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">2B</td><td class=\"c\">C00</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 00</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 &rarr; E</td><td class=\"a\">2C</td><td class=\"c\">11E</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 1,E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">2D</td><td class=\"c\">C27</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 27</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANZ</td><td rowspan=\"7\">ANZ = show display</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 &rarr; E</td><td class=\"a\">2E</td><td class=\"c\">12E</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 2,E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">2F</td><td class=\"c\">C27</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 27</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANZ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 &rarr; E</td><td class=\"a\">30</td><td class=\"c\">15E</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 5,E</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">31</td><td class=\"c\">C27</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 27</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANZ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 &rarr; E</td><td class=\"a\">32</td><td class=\"c\">11F</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 1,F</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">33</td><td class=\"c\">C27</td><td class=\"m\">GOTO 27</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">MORI</td><td class=\"a\">34</td><td class=\"c\">078</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 7,8</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td rowspan=\"11\">&bdquo;Subroutine&ldquo; MORI = move right, i.e. shift the zeros in reg. 3 to 8 to the right, equivalent to shifting the display digits to the left.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">35</td><td class=\"c\">067</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 6,7</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">36</td><td class=\"c\">056</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 5,6</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">37</td><td class=\"c\">045</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 4,5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">38</td><td class=\"c\">034</td><td class=\"m\">MOV 3,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">39</td><td class=\"c\">993</td><td class=\"m\">CMPI 9,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">3A</td><td class=\"c\">D3D</td><td class=\"m\">BRC 3D</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">3B</td><td class=\"c\">103</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 0,3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">3C</td><td class=\"c\">F07</td><td class=\"m\">RET</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">3D</td><td class=\"c\">104</td><td class=\"m\">MOVI 0,4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td><td class=\"a\">3E</td><td class=\"c\">F07</td><td class=\"m\">RET</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"></td></tr></table>"
  },
  "8": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Program start: HALT &ndash; NEXT &ndash; 00 &ndash; RUN. The display shows: 0.</p></div>"
  },
  "9": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Place the silver-colored keypad mask labeled &bdquo;Widerstands-Code&ldquo; on the keypad with the cover hood open, and close the hood again.</p></div>"
  },
  "10": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Most resistors have 4 color rings, one of which is silver or gold. For the resistance-value calculation the gold or silver ring must be on the right. The entry therefore begins with the colors (see figure): yellow &ndash; violet &ndash; black &ndash; gold. The display counts the key presses and now shows the digit 4. The color entry is concluded by pressing the key &uarr; (top key row).</p></div>"
  },
  "11": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The display shows 0047. The entered color values correspond to a resistance value of 47 &Omega; (ohms). Pressing the &uarr; key again shows: 05, i.e. that the calculated resistance value has a tolerance of &plusmn; 5%.</p></div>"
  },
  "12": {
    "de": "",
    "en": "<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.05;text-align:justify\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Pressing the &uarr; key again brings 0 back on the display. A new entry can be made.</p></div>"
  }
}